{"unit_id":"tag:0EWF:proof","translation":"由引理<REF_0001>，《景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites）》第<REF_0002>节的引理均适用于当前情形。为将结论转换到这里，注意范畴（category）<MATH_0001>（来自《景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites）》引理<REF_0003>）是<MATH_0002>的满子范畴（full subcategory），由形如<MATH_0003>的层（sheaves）组成，其中<MATH_0004>是<MATH_0005>上的阿贝尔（abelian）挠（torsion）层（sheaf）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n第 (1) 部分等价（equivalent）于<MATH_0006>对于所有<MATH_0007>成立，这由《景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites）》引理<REF_0004>成立。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n第 (2) 部分由将<MATH_0008>应用于《景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites）》引理<REF_0005>的结论得到。\n\n<STRUCT_0005><STRUCT_0006>\n第 (3) 部分由《景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites）》引理<REF_0006>第 (1) 部分得到，因为<MATH_0009>属于<MATH_0010>且<MATH_0011>。\n\n<STRUCT_0007><STRUCT_0008>\n第 (4) 部分由《景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites）》引理<REF_0007>第 (2) 部分得到，理由相同。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"景上的上同调"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"景上的上同调"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"满子范畴"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"abelian","target_term":"阿贝尔"},{"source_term":"torsion","target_term":"挠"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"景上的上同调"},{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"景上的上同调"},{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"景上的上同调"},{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"景上的上同调"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"景上的上同调","context":"章节引用"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"适用范围"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"满子范畴","context":"系数范围"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"子范畴对象"},{"source_term":"abelian","target_term":"阿贝尔","context":"系数性质"},{"source_term":"torsion","target_term":"挠","context":"系数性质"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"系数对象"},{"source_te